          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would die as a result of a failed recovery check or saving throw.</p><hr /><p>Your previous life ended due to sheer poor luck, struck by lightning or choking on a fish bone. You can reroll the triggering recovery check or saving throw, but you must use the new result, even if it's worse.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> You can select this feat only at 1st level, and you can't retrain into or out of this feat.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          },
